# ================================================================
# MODULE 25  nebula_node_advanced.py — Full Node Enhancement
# ================================================================
# Advanced node features: alert system, BIP9 soft forks,
# peer scoring, network topology, node health monitoring,
# automated backup, log management, node telemetry.
