# """
# NEBULA v10.12 - Group 1 (5 classes revived and hardened, plus the wiring layer)
#
#     DoubleSpendDetector     -> Mempool.submit            (outpoint reservation + RBF + block eviction)
#     TransactionSpamFilter   -> Mempool.submit            (token bucket, bounded memory, expiring bans)
#     CheckpointVerifier      -> NEBULABlockchain.add_block (+ reorg-below-checkpoint guard)
#     FinalityEngine          -> REST /api/tx, /api/address (confirmations + Nakamoto double-spend risk)
#     FeeFilter               -> P2P tx relay              (BIP 133, per-kB units, per-peer state)
#
# Design rules (from the project owner):
#   * surgical: nothing in nebula_v10_11.py is rewritten; everything attaches by wrapping/hooks
#   * real: no simulated behaviour; real maths (Nakamoto/Rosenfeld), real data structures
#   * reversible: Group1Wiring.detach() restores the original methods exactly
