# ================================================================
#
# Problem solved:
#   A worker in Dubai sends money home to Kabul.
#   Current cost: 8-15% fee + 2-5 day delay.
#   With NEBULA: ~0.0001 NBL fee + 10 minute confirmation.
#
# How it works:
#   1. Sender buys NBL locally (at local exchange or peer)
#   2. Sends NBL directly to recipient's phone wallet
#   3. Recipient converts NBL to local currency at local exchange
#   4. Total fee: <0.01%  |  Time: ~10 minutes
#
# No bank. No SWIFT. No permission needed.
# Works on any device that runs Python.
