# ==========================================================================
# NEBULA PROTOCOL SPECIFICATION — Full Technical Reference
# ==========================================================================

# ── Transaction Wire Format ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Field            | Type     | Size     | Description
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# version             | int32     | 4 bytes   | Transaction version number
# input_count         | varint    | 1-9 b     | Number of transaction inputs
# inputs[]            | TxIn[]    | variable  | List of inputs
#   prev_hash         | bytes32   | 32 bytes  | Previous tx hash
#   prev_index        | uint32    | 4 bytes   | Output index in previous tx
#   script_len        | varint    | 1-9 b     | Length of scriptSig
#   scriptSig         | bytes     | variable  | Unlocking script
#   sequence          | uint32    | 4 bytes   | Sequence number (RBF)
# output_count        | varint    | 1-9 b     | Number of outputs
# outputs[]           | TxOut[]   | variable  | List of outputs
#   value             | int64     | 8 bytes   | Value in Neb (satoshi equiv)
#   script_len        | varint    | 1-9 b     | Length of scriptPubKey
#   scriptPubKey      | bytes     | variable  | Locking script
# locktime            | uint32    | 4 bytes   | Block or timestamp locktime

# ── Block Header Wire Format ────────────────────────────────────────
# version             | int32     | 4 bytes   | Block version
# prev_hash           | bytes32   | 32 bytes  | Previous block hash
# merkle_root         | bytes32   | 32 bytes  | Merkle root of transactions
# timestamp           | uint32    | 4 bytes   | Unix timestamp
# bits                | uint32    | 4 bytes   | Compact difficulty target
# nonce               | uint32    | 4 bytes   | Mining nonce
# Total header size: 80 bytes

# ── DeFi Mathematical Formulas ─────────────────────────────────────
# AMM Constant Product                x * y = k                                 # Uniswap v2 invariant
# CLMM Price                          P = y/x in active range                   # Concentrated liquidity spot
# LP Share                            shares = amount / total * supply          # Proportional LP tokens
# IL Formula                          IL = 2*sqrt(r)/(1+r) - 1                  # r = price_new/price_old
# Borrow Rate                         r = base + slope*util                     # Kink model below kink
# Borrow Rate High                    r = base+s1+s2*(util-kink)/(1-kink)       # Above kink
# Supply Rate                         supply_r = borrow_r * util * (1-rf)       # rf = reserve factor
# Health Factor                       HF = col*liq_thresh / debt                # Must stay > 1.0
# Liquidation Price                   liq = debt / (col * liq_thresh)           # Price triggers liquidation
# veNBL Power                         veNBL = amount * time_remaining/max       # Decays linearly
# Staking Reward                      reward = rate * stake * time              # Simple interest
# Compound Reward                     final = P*(1+r/n)^(n*t)                   # Compounded n times/yr
# Impermanent Loss %                  IL% = (2*sqrt(r)/(1+r)-1)*100             # Price change relative
# Price Impact                        impact = amount_in / reserve_in           # Approximate slippage
# APR to APY                          APY = (1+APR/n)^n - 1                     # n = compound frequency
# APY to APR                          APR = n*((1+APY)^(1/n)-1)                 # n = compound frequency
# LMSR Price                          p_i = exp(q_i/b)/sum(exp(q_j/b))          # Prediction market
# LMSR Cost                           C = b*log(sum(exp(q_i/b)))                # Liquidity parameter b
# Black-Scholes Call                  C = S*N(d1) - K*e^(-rT)*N(d2)             # European call price
# d1                                  d1=(log(S/K)+(r+s^2/2)*T)/(s*T^0.5)       # BS d1 parameter
# d2                                  d2 = d1 - s*sqrt(T)                       # BS d2 parameter
# Stock-to-Flow                       P = 0.4 * SF^3                            # Plan B model
# Metcalfe Value                      V = c * n^2                               # Network effect model
# NVT Ratio                           NVT = market_cap / daily_volume           # On-chain fundamentals
# TWAP                                TWAP = sum(P_i)/n over window             # Time-weighted avg price
# Realized Volatility                 RV = std(log(P_t/P_t-1))*sqrt(252)        # Annualized vol
# Gini Coefficient                    G = sum((2i-n-1)*x_i)/(n*sum(x))          # Distribution inequality
# Rule of 72                          years_to_double = 72/APY%                 # Approximate doubling
# Flash Loan Fee                      fee = amount * fee_bps / 10000            # Fee on borrowed amount
# Royalty Amount                      royalty = sale_price * rate               # NFT creator royalty

# ── NEBULA REST API Endpoints Reference ─────────────────────────────
# Method | Path                          | Description
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GET    | /                              | Node info and status
# GET    | /health                        | Health check
# GET    | /blockchain/info               | Chain height, supply, difficulty
# GET    | /blockchain/best-block         | Latest block header
# GET    | /block/{height}                | Block by height
# GET    | /block/{hash}                  | Block by hash
# GET    | /block/{height}/txs            | Block transactions
# GET    | /tx/{txid}                     | Transaction by ID
# POST   | /tx/broadcast                  | Broadcast raw transaction
# GET    | /address/{addr}                | Address info and balance
# GET    | /address/{addr}/utxos          | UTXOs for address
# GET    | /address/{addr}/txs            | Transactions for address
# GET    | /mempool                       | Mempool info
# GET    | /mempool/txs                   | Pending transactions
# GET    | /mempool/fees                  | Fee estimates
# GET    | /mining/info                   | Mining stats
# GET    | /mining/template               | Block template for miners
# POST   | /mining/submit                 | Submit solved block
# GET    | /network/peers                 | Connected peers
# GET    | /network/stats                 | Network statistics
# GET    | /staking/pools                 | Available staking pools
# GET    | /staking/{addr}                | Staking info for address
# POST   | /staking/stake                 | Stake NBL
# POST   | /staking/unstake               | Unstake NBL
# GET    | /dex/pools                     | DEX liquidity pools
# GET    | /dex/pools/{id}                | Pool details
# POST   | /dex/swap                      | Execute swap
# POST   | /dex/liquidity/add             | Add liquidity
# POST   | /dex/liquidity/remove          | Remove liquidity
# GET    | /governance/proposals          | Active proposals
# POST   | /governance/propose            | Submit proposal
# POST   | /governance/vote               | Cast vote
# GET    | /nft/collections               | NFT collections
# GET    | /nft/{collection}/{id}         | NFT details
# POST   | /nft/mint                      | Mint NFT
# POST   | /nft/transfer                  | Transfer NFT
# GET    | /oracle/prices                 | Current oracle prices
# GET    | /oracle/{pair}                 | Price for specific pair
# GET    | /bridge/status                 | Bridge status
# POST   | /bridge/lock                   | Lock for bridge
# GET    | /supply/schedule               | Emission schedule
# GET    | /supply/distribution           | Supply distribution
# GET    | /fees/history                  | Fee market history
# GET    | /docs                          | API documentation
# GET    | /version                       | API version
# GET    | /metrics                       | Prometheus metrics

# ── WebSocket Event Types ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Event                   | Description
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# new_block                | Emitted when new block is mined
# new_tx                   | New transaction entered mempool
# tx_confirmed             | Transaction confirmed in block
# tx_rejected              | Transaction rejected from mempool
# price_update             | Oracle price updated
# swap_executed            | DEX swap completed
# liquidity_added          | Liquidity added to pool
# liquidity_removed        | Liquidity removed from pool
# stake_created            | New stake position opened
# stake_closed             | Stake position closed
# reward_distributed       | Staking reward distributed
# proposal_created         | Governance proposal submitted
# vote_cast                | Vote cast on proposal
# proposal_executed        | Proposal executed on-chain
# nft_minted               | New NFT minted
# nft_transferred          | NFT transferred
# nft_listed               | NFT listed for sale
# nft_sold                 | NFT sale completed
# bridge_lock              | Asset locked for bridging
# bridge_release           | Asset released from bridge
# liquidation              | Position liquidated
# halving                  | Block reward halving occurred
# difficulty_adj           | Mining difficulty adjusted
# peer_connected           | New P2P peer connected
# peer_disconnected        | P2P peer disconnected
# circuit_breaker          | Circuit breaker triggered
# oracle_deviation         | Oracle price deviation alert

