# ── Smart Contract Security Checklist ──────────────────────────────
# [ ] Reentrancy guard on all state-changing external calls
# [ ] Integer overflow protection (Python natively handles this)
# [ ] Access control on privileged functions (onlyOwner/onlyGovernance)
# [ ] Proper input validation and bounds checking
# [ ] Slippage protection in DEX swaps
# [ ] Oracle price staleness checks
# [ ] Flash loan attack prevention (price oracle in same block)
# [ ] Front-running protection via commit-reveal or TWAP
# [ ] Signature replay protection via nonces
# [ ] ERC-20 approve/transferFrom race condition handling
# [ ] Proper event emission for off-chain monitoring
# [ ] Timelock on governance parameter changes
# [ ] Circuit breaker for abnormal activity
# [ ] Economic security: minimum viable collateral ratios
# [ ] Dust threshold enforcement
# [ ] Fee griefing prevention
# [ ] Cross-chain message replay protection
# [ ] Bridge asset reconciliation checks
# [ ] Merkle proof validation for airdrops
# [ ] VRF unpredictability for random number generation
# [ ] Post-quantum readiness assessment
# [ ] Emergency pause functionality
# [ ] Upgrade proxy storage collision prevention
# [ ] Denial-of-service via gas griefing prevention
# [ ] Precision loss in fixed-point arithmetic
# [ ] Sandwich attack mitigation in AMM
# [ ] MEV-resistant ordering where possible
# [ ] Validator set centralization monitoring
# [ ] Key ceremony documentation for multisig
# [ ] Incident response plan documented

